OL,3,ATrump calls Putin his 'friend' ahead of
OL,4,Atheir meeting with Xi in China
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump calls Vladimir Putin his
OL,7,F"friend" and says they have a "great
OL,8,Frelationship" before they hold a
OL,9,Fmeeting with China's President Xi in
OL,10,FShenzhen
OL,12,FTrump held separate, bilateral meetings
OL,13,Fwith Putin and Xi before the three-way
OL,14,Ftalks, which are due to start soon
OL,16,FOne of Putin's aides said the bilateral
OL,17,Fmeeting with Trump went "well", with
OL,18,FPutin in an "excellent mood"
OL,20,FAfter meeting Xi, Trump said the US and
OL,21,FChina want to see an end to the Ukraine
OL,22,Fwar
